{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"22896","name":"NH Alcorcon","description":"The NH Alcorcón boasts a prime location near Alcorcón's historic center and the offices of several leading national and international companies. Parque Oeste Shopping Center is just an 8-minute walk from the hotel, and central Madrid, with the Royal Palace and Prado Museum, is only half an hour away by metro. Our 102 inviting rooms offer all the modern conveniences, including free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs, minibars, and sitting areas. A freshly prepared breakfast buffet is served every morning, with an early-bird option and hot dishes cooked to order upon request. Nhube Restaurant, our dining space, prepares delicious Mediterranean dishes for dinner Monday through Thursday. You can purchase hot and cold snacks and drinks any time of the day or night at the self-service open bar. The hotel has five meeting rooms with a maximum capacity of 220 people. With advance notice, we can arrange a menu and other business or event services, such as audiovisual equipment. The gym, free for hotel guests, includes cardiovascular machines, a sauna, and complimentary towels. The outdoor terrace next to the restaurant is perfect for relaxing or holding business meetings.","address":"Avda. Europa - Edificio A, 2","city":"ALCORCON","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"28922","lat":40.3504259944752,"lng":-3.84613572154194,"stars":4,"chain":"NH","giataCode":"60812","phone":"+34916593606","email":"nhalcorcon@nh-hotels.com","website":"www.nh-hoteles.es/hotel/nh-alcorcon","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022896/022896a_hb_a_002.jpg?20240819143110?20250624011515","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022896/022896a_hb_a_001.jpg?20250405124643?20250624011515","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/02/022896/022896a_hb_a_003.jpg?20250405124644?20250624011515","category":"exterior","order":2},{"u